Cell["\<\
The option \
GroupBy\[Rule]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]Grade\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] groups \
basis elements into list according to their grade. This is only possible to \
do for orderings, which name proceed with \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Deg\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] or \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]InvDeg\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote].\
\>", "Text",
